@startuml
title 4G Default Bearer Setup

participant UE
participant eNB
participant MME
participant SGW
participant PGW

UE -> eNB: Attach Request (trigger)
eNB -> MME: Initial UE Message

MME -> SGW: Create Session Request
SGW -> PGW: Create Session Request
PGW -> SGW: Create Session Response
SGW -> MME: Create Session Response

MME -> eNB: Initial Context Setup Request
eNB -> UE: RRC Reconfiguration (Bearer Setup)

@enduml
